desc:TwoStorms Act
tags: utility gain metering calibration transient dynamics
author: TwoStorms
version: 1.0
//
// A gain stage to drop after any plug-in. Default: one linked stereo pair (one
// fader); up to 8 channels, pairs can be unlinked and single channels switched
// off. Output meters, Auto in three modes (Target: the output hits Target; Match: it
// equals the previous Act's output; Reference: it equals the reference chosen in the
// Gain Stage's toolbar), Drive link (when this Act's gain changes,
// another Act or a plug-in parameter moves the opposite way; engage switch). The last Act in a
// chain is its finale (listed on the Gain Stage's Finales tab); its Finale setting can say Always
// or Never instead. An optional transient shaper (1 to 3 bands, attack and sustain per band, optional lookahead,
// before the gain) is off by default and costs nothing while off. TwoStorms Gain Stage lists and
// remote-controls every Act; settings live here, in each Act. Zero latency.
// Needs REAPER 6.74 or newer. The helper script (twostorms_helper.lua) supplies
// plug-in and track names, the exact chain order and plug-in parameter links.

slider1:0<0,3,1{2,4,6,8}>-Channels
slider2:0<0,2,1{Auto,Always,Never}>-Finale (Auto = the last Act in the chain)
slider3:0<0,2,1{Peak,RMS,LUFS}>-Auto measure
slider4:-12<-60,0,0.01>-Auto target
slider5:4<0,7,1{Manual,1 s,2 s,3 s,5 s,10 s,20 s,30 s}>-Auto time
slider6:1<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Link 1-2
slider7:1<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Link 3-4
slider8:1<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Link 5-6
slider9:1<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Link 7-8
slider10:0<-100,60,0.01>-Ch1 gain (dB, -100 = -inf)
slider11:0<-100,60,0.01>-Ch2 gain (dB, -100 = -inf)
slider12:0<-100,60,0.01>-Ch3 gain (dB, -100 = -inf)
slider13:0<-100,60,0.01>-Ch4 gain (dB, -100 = -inf)
slider14:0<-100,60,0.01>-Ch5 gain (dB, -100 = -inf)
slider15:0<-100,60,0.01>-Ch6 gain (dB, -100 = -inf)
slider16:0<-100,60,0.01>-Ch7 gain (dB, -100 = -inf)
slider17:0<-100,60,0.01>-Ch8 gain (dB, -100 = -inf)
slider18:1<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Ch1 used
slider19:1<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Ch2 used
slider20:1<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Ch3 used
slider21:1<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Ch4 used
slider22:1<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Ch5 used
slider23:1<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Ch6 used
slider24:1<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Ch7 used
slider25:1<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Ch8 used
slider26:0<0,14,1>-Ch1 match source
slider27:0<0,14,1>-Ch2 match source
slider28:0<0,14,1>-Ch3 match source
slider29:0<0,14,1>-Ch4 match source
slider30:0<0,14,1>-Ch5 match source
slider31:0<0,14,1>-Ch6 match source
slider32:0<0,14,1>-Ch7 match source
slider33:0<0,14,1>-Ch8 match source
slider34:0<0,999999,1>-Drive link target ID
slider35:0<0,999999,1>-Reference ID
slider36:0<0,999999,1>-Instance ID
slider37:3<0,5,1{Off,1 s,2 s,5 s,10 s,Infinite}>-Peak hold
slider38:3<0,5,1{24 dB,36 dB,48 dB,60 dB,72 dB,96 dB}>-Meter range
slider39:1<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Drive link engaged
slider40:0<0,2,1{Target,Match,Reference}>-Auto mode
slider41:-200<-200,60,0.01>-Level the last Match/Reference aimed for (-200 = none)
slider42:1<0,5,1{100%,115%,130%,150%,175%,200%}>-Window zoom
slider43:0<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Transient shaper
slider44:0<-100,100,0.1>-Transient shaper: low attack (%)
slider45:0<-100,100,0.1>-Transient shaper: low sustain (%)
slider46:0<-100,100,0.1>-Transient shaper: mid attack (%)
slider47:0<-100,100,0.1>-Transient shaper: mid sustain (%)
slider48:0<-100,100,0.1>-Transient shaper: high attack (%)
slider49:0<-100,100,0.1>-Transient shaper: high sustain (%)
slider50:200<20,20000,1>-Transient shaper: crossover 1 (Hz)
slider51:2500<20,20000,1>-Transient shaper: crossover 2 (Hz)
slider52:0<0,1,1>-Unused
slider53:0<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Transient shaper: crossover 1 used
slider54:0<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Transient shaper: crossover 2 used
slider55:0<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Transient shaper: lookahead
slider56:2<0.1,10,0.01>-Transient shaper: lookahead time (ms)
in_pin:In 1
in_pin:In 2
in_pin:In 3
in_pin:In 4
